Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, I’m Athos. I work where design, communication,\Nand practical AI workflows meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,For this challenge, I built SiteCheck with IBM Bob:\Na focused review loop for small websites.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It gives people evidence\Nthey can actually act on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.00,0:00:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This demo has three intentional problems:\Nmissing alt text, a missing label, and a broken link.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.00,0:00:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,SiteCheck turns each problem into a finding with an ID,\Nseverity, location, evidence, and recommendation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.00,0:00:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The important part is the recheck.\NI chose the missing form label first.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.00,0:00:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It affects how a user understands the field,\Nand the correction is easy to verify.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:00:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,After the change, I run the same checks again:\None verified fix and two findings still open.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.00,0:01:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There are zero new regressions,\Nand the project has forty-two passing tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.00,0:01:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,IBM Bob helped me plan and implement the Python workflow\Nacross three documented sessions.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.50,0:01:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I kept product scope, prioritization, code review,\Nand art direction under human control.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That review caught a state-handling issue\Nthat could have hidden a new regression.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.50,0:01:30.60,FinalTop,,0,0,0,,Find a problem, decide what matters,\Nfix it, and prove the result.
